d & Table View</span><span style=\"padding:3px 9px;border-radius:5px;background:rgba(99,102,241,.1);font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#6366f1;\">Dynamic Search</span><span style=\"padding:3px 9px;border-radius:5px;background:rgba(16,185,129,.1);font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#10b981;\">Add / Edit Drawer</span><span style=\"padding:3px 9px;border-radius:5px;background:rgba(239,68,68,.1);font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#ef4444;\">Delete Confirmation</span><span style=\"padding:3px 9px;border-radius:5px;background:rgba(124,58,237,.1);font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#7c3aed;\">Audit History Timeline</span></div></div></div></div>"
          }
